<title>BELGIUM: CNP/NPM H1 1997 NET PROFIT JUMPS 33 PCT.</title>
<headline>CNP/NPM H1 1997 NET PROFIT JUMPS 33 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 (billions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit		    3.250   v    2.435</p>
<p>    Current profit			2.696   v    2.344</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian holding company Nationale Portefeuillemaatschappij/Compagnie Nationale a Portefeuille said in a statement on restricted earnings that based on first half results, it was planning to maintain its current dividend policy.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
